{"channelId":"UCi07nItDsxaqTMBJ-5zacPw","row":["Chiropractic Health Channel",586,"Welcome to the Chiropractic Health Channel, where our goal is to empower you to achieve vibrant health through informed decisions and practices.  We do this by bringing to you important information and health best practices that enable you to make meaningful, wise decisions when it comes to managing what is probably your most important asset: your good health!     \nOur fundamental premise is that the most important player on your health care and maintenance team is you.  If your wish is to enjoy good health and the vibrant quality of life that accompanies it, the decisions that you make about your health are very, very important.  And you cannot make wise decisions, the kind that will have a major impact upon your quality of life, without good information.\n\nWe have compiled the wisdom, tools and advice from hundreds of experts on the subject of chiropractic from all over the world and offer them here in a series of what we call \"Patient Enlightenment Moments\". Enjoy!","info@bennettclinic.net","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi07nItDsxaqTMBJ-5zacPw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi07nItDsxaqTMBJ-5zacPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:53.306Z","channelId":"UCi07nItDsxaqTMBJ-5zacPw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a63fcc8d653922ede51ff93fc63c6ed7ca61dcb2d8eac77ecfa302b4cfbdcff0","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"381166626a304df54ef110ab188e8562480cea1ec022dd592249c3a0f26eb762"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi07nItDsxaqTMBJ-5zacPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:53.306Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi07nItDsxaqTMBJ-5zacPw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":586,"raw":"586 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi07nItDsxaqTMBJ-5zacPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T